Key Insights:
1. Overall Retention: Average retention gradually decreases from 100% in Week 0 to 88.38% in Week 6.
2. Cohort Differences: Retention varies across cohorts, with some maintaining consistently higher retention rates than others.
3. Strong-Performing Cohort: The cohort starting on 21 December 2020 demonstrates relatively strong retention throughout the observed period.
4. Seasonal Pattern (Hypothesis): December cohorts appear to demonstrate stronger retention. One possible explanation could be seasonal behaviour associated with Christmas and New Year, when subscription engagement or purchasing activity may change.
